// The how-tos of the user lens: one task each, in the order a new user meets
// them.
include = [
  "./write_rules.heron",
  "./define_an_api.heron",
  "./run_a_task.heron",
  "./add_a_ts_extension.heron",
  "./use_the_editor.heron",
  "./split_spec_and_implementation.heron",
  "./version_a_product.heron",
]

@lens(user)
| One task each, from writing rules to publishing a versioned spec.
